  "defect": "Minecraft.resize replaces loadingScreen with a fresh LoadingScreenRenderer, discarding currentlyDisplayedText/message. Baseline loading-resize-base1-amd (probe-only build 3d8f5e7cc): post-replacement stages 6-8 show title=\"\" while size tracked correctly.",
